<https://w3id.org/desmos/isRevealedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di revealsConstraint: questa proprietà collega una costrizione letteraria all'evidenza testuale che ne permette l'identificazione. La proprietà ha come domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint e come range desmos:TextualFeature."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isRevealedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of revealsConstraint: this property relates a literary constraint to the textual feature that makes it identifiable. The property has domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint and range desmos:TextualFeature."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isRevealedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is revealed by"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isRevealedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "è rivelata da"@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isRevealedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isRevealedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isRevealedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isRevealedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isRevealedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/desmos/revealsConstraint> .
